ilt for growth being  able to experience lighter operational  burden high availability and ability to  scale rapidly is really important for wp  engines growth at this point  so thank you  like i said i'm super excited about  seeing what unleashing the full power of  cloud is going to bring  in for wp engine in the coming months  and years  so super excited thank you
 

